": 1725651400, "avatar": "b55ddf3ca27f0c205cee608b6381523fb3b7ee6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Flowing and fast pace arena shooter with a bunch of charm. Imagine if a borderlands had a rogue-like spin off.\n\nHaving previously enjoyed Gunfire Reborn and Risk of Rain 2, I came to Roboquest with high hopes, and it delivers a fantastic experience. Dodging and crouch strafing whilst pumping out damaging with 100% focus state is exactly what I was after. \n\nAll the little secrets and interactions really showed that the devs went that extra mile and I struggle to find fault with any one aspect, maybe a clearer levelling up system/skill tree would be nice. Overall, highly recommend!\n", "timestamp_created": 1722440870, "timestamp_updated": 1722440870, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}